Peppol BIS Billing 3 Schematron artefacts (runtime data, not Klopt source)

At build / develop time this project may download ISO Schematron rule files
from OpenPEPPOL/peppol-bis-invoice-3 (pinned release; see
tools/fetch-peppol-bis3.sh and reference-data/peppol/README.md). Those files
are not committed to this Apache-2.0 repository and are not relicensed by
Klopt.

- CEN-EN16931-UBL.sch carries an EUPL-1.2 header from its publisher (CEN /
  Connecting Europe material redistributed by OpenPeppol). EUPL is the
  publisher's licence for that artefact, not a licence claim for Klopt.
- PEPPOL-EN16931-UBL.sch is published by OpenPeppol AISBL. OpenPeppol holds
  copyright in Peppol BIS and restricts modification / redistribution of the
  BIS without prior consent; obtain the artefacts from the official provenance
  named in reference-data/peppol/README.md.

Container images built from this Dockerfile fetch the pinned checksum-verified
bytes into /app/reference-data for runtime validation only. Images built from
this Dockerfile contain these files. Publishing such an image redistributes
them and needs OpenPeppol's consent; this project does not publish images.

